ow><mo stretchy=\"false\">^</mo></mover></mrow><mi>i</mi><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mi>V</mi></mrow></msubsup><msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><msub><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mover><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">D</mi></mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">^</mo></mover></mrow><mi>i</mi></msub><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mo>/</mo></mrow><mi>ϕ</mi></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container></span>\nis the independence-model information and <span class=\"math inline\"><mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"CHTML\" style=\"font-size: 113.1%; position: relative;\" data-tex=\"\\hat{\\mathbf{V}}_{\\text{R}}\"><mjx-math class=\" MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><mjx-msub><mjx-TeXAtom texclass=\"ORD\"><mjx-mover><mjx-over style=\"padding-bottom: 0.105em; padding-left: 0.434em; margin-bottom: -0.531em;\"><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\" style=\"width: 0; margin-left: -0.25em;\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c5E\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo></mjx-over><mjx-base><mjx-TeXAtom texclass=\"ORD\"><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-b\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D415 TEX-B\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi></mjx-TeXAtom></mjx-base></mjx-mover></mjx-TeXAtom><mjx-script style=\"vertical-align: -0.15em;\"><mjx-TeXAtom size=\"s\" texclass=\"ORD\"><mjx-mtext class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c52\"></mjx-c></mjx-mtext></mjx-TeXAtom></mjx-script></mjx-msub></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable=\"on\" display=\"inline\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mover><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">V</mi></mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">^</mo></mover></mrow><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mtext>R</mtext></mrow></msub></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container></span> is <span class=\"citation\" data-cites=\"eq-gmm-sandwich\">@eq-gmm-sandwich</span>.\nIf the working model is correct the trace is <span class=\"math inline\"><mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"CHTML\" style=\"font-size: 113.1%; position: relative;\" data-tex=\"p\"><mjx-math class=\" MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D45D TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable=\"on\" display=\"inline\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>p</mi></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container></span> and <span class=\"citation\" data-cites=\"eq-gmm-qic\">@eq-gmm-qic</span> is the Akaike form <span class=\"citation\" data-cites=\"def-sel-aic-bic\">@def-sel-aic-bic</span>.\nIt is a sound criterion for choosing the <em>mean model</em>, and a\nweakly justified one for choosing <span class=\"math inline\"><mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"CHTML\" style=\"font-size: 113.1%; position: relative;\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf{R}_i\"><mjx-math class=\" MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><mjx-msub><mjx-TeXAtom texclass=\"ORD\"><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-b\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D411 TEX-B\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi></mjx-TeXAtom><mjx-script style=\"vertical-align: -0.15em;\"><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\" size=\"s\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D456 TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi></mjx-script></mjx-msub></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable=\"on\" display=\"inline\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">R</mi></mrow><mi>i</mi></msub></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container></span>.</p></li>\n</ol>\n</div>","file":"ch40-glmm-gee/05-working-correlation.html"}